WEBVTT

1
00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:47.125
In these verses 12.18 and 12.19 of Chapter 12,

2
00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.458
Lord Krishna continues

3
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:50.416
the explanation of the qualities

4
00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.541
of an ideal devotee.

5
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:54.750
Elaborating on the quality of equanimity,

6
00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.041
He says

7
00:00:56.041 --> 00:00:57.666
that an ideal devotee

8
00:00:57.666 --> 00:01:00.750
is unaffected by external circumstances.

9
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.500
Neither by friendship, nor enmity, nor honour,

10
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.958
nor insult.

11
00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:08.458
Neither by heat, nor cold,

12
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:11.000
neither by joy, nor sorrow.

13
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.333
This verse begins with three words,

14
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:22.166
samah shatrau ca mitre ca,

15
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:24.083
meaning a devotee, toward friends

16
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:28.375
and enemies both, holds equal feeling.

17
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:29.958
They hold no enmity toward those

18
00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:32.125
who think or act badly toward them,

19
00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:36.000
nor attachment toward those who take their side.

20
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.791
They know that whether praise

21
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:38.958
or criticism,

22
00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:43.083
success or failure, everything is temporary,

23
00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:44.541
and none of these

24
00:01:44.541 --> 00:01:48.625
diverts them from their spiritual goal.

25
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:50.541
Manapamanyoh,

26
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:52.416
meaning they remain steady

27
00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:55.041
in both honour and insult.

28
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:58.541
Ordinarily a person chases honour

29
00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:00.708
and fears insult,

30
00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:04.666
but a devotee is above both.

31
00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.291
Shitoshna sukhaduhkheshu,

32
00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:11.208
meaning whether cold or heat, joy

33
00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:12.250
or sorrow,

34
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.208
the devotee remains the same
in every situation.

35
00:02:15.208 --> 00:02:16.250
They know

36
00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.625
that physical and worldly difficulties

37
00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:21.916
are only temporary guests, and for this reason

38
00:02:21.916 --> 00:02:25.375
these do not unsettle their mind.

39
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:26.958
In simple or difficult

40
00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:29.833
circumstances alike, without wavering

41
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:33.000
they remain engaged in
devotion to Lord Krishna.

42
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.125
Samah sanga-varjitah,

43
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:37.500
meaning they stay away from

44
00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:39.625
and unaffected by bad company.

45
00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:40.958
They do not keep company

46
00:02:40.958 --> 00:02:42.750
for attachment, indulgence,

47
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.416
or the satisfaction of the senses.

48
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:47.458
The company that appeals to them

49
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:49.916
is only what supports their path of devotion

50
00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:54.208
and inspires spiritual progress.

51
00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:55.875
Tulya-ninda-stutih,

52
00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.791
meaning whether people blame or praise them,

53
00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.583
they are unaffected.

54
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:01.666
They know

55
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:04.958
that these are all matters of a moment.

56
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:07.666
Mauni, meaning being silent.

57
00:03:07.666 --> 00:03:08.583
This does not mean

58
00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:10.291
they speak nothing at all.

59
00:03:10.291 --> 00:03:11.666
It means

60
00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:13.958
this devotee, on unnecessary topics,

61
00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:16.791
commenting on someone,
speaking ill of anyone,

62
00:03:16.791 --> 00:03:18.958
or on negative matters,

63
00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:20.666
remains silent.

64
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:23.333
But if the matter is positive,

65
00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:25.416
or relates to spirituality and devotion,

66
00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:28.041
then they certainly speak.

67
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.208
Santushto yena kenacit,

68
00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:32.375
meaning whatever they receive,

69
00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:34.083
they remain content.

70
00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:35.000
Whether food

71
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.541
or living conditions, in abundance or simplicity,

72
00:03:38.541 --> 00:03:42.333
they are grateful and satisfied in every situation,

73
00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:43.708
because their real fulfilment

74
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:45.458
comes not from external things,

75
00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:49.958
but from their inner connection with Lord Krishna.

76
00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:51.250
Aniketah,

77
00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.500
one who has no attachment to a fixed dwelling.

78
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.875
This does not mean

79
00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:57.583
that they have no shelter,

80
00:03:57.583 --> 00:04:00.750
or that they just wander about in detachment.

81
00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.375
It simply means that their mind

82
00:04:03.375 --> 00:04:06.083
is not captivated by any one shelter.

83
00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:09.416
Whatever the place of residence may be,

84
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:10.541
their true shelter

85
00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:14.916
is at the feet of Lord Krishna.

86
00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:16.916
Sthira-matih, meaning

87
00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:19.791
their intellect is steady.

88
00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:20.833
That is, their thoughts

89
00:04:20.833 --> 00:04:23.625
and convictions do not keep wavering.

90
00:04:23.625 --> 00:04:25.833
They fall into no doubt,

91
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:28.791
nor does any external influence disturb them.

92
00:04:28.791 --> 00:04:32.625
They are completely firm and
steady in their devotion.

93
00:04:32.625 --> 00:04:34.875
And finally, Lord Krishna says

94
00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:36.875
that a devotee endowed with such qualities

95
00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:39.375
is most dear to Him.

96
00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:42.416
The qualities here are many, but attaining them

97
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:43.791
is quite simple.

98
00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:46.500
All these qualities come on their own

99
00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.041
when someone takes shelter in Lord Krishna,

100
00:04:48.041 --> 00:04:51.541
with a selfless heart and considers their every

101
00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:55.500
action as fully dedicated to His service.

102
00:05:00.291 --> 00:05:03.041
Have you ever stopped

103
00:05:03.041 --> 00:05:05.875
to notice

104
00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:09.625
how much of our energy in personal life

105
00:05:09.625 --> 00:05:13.041
is wasted on unnecessary things?

106
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:17.666
Sometimes arguments, sometimes
criticism of others,

107
00:05:17.666 --> 00:05:21.083
sometimes complaining about situations.

108
00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:25.041
These bring no real benefit,

109
00:05:25.041 --> 00:05:27.625
nor does the situation change.

110
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:34.583
But all of this certainly creates
noise in your mind.

111
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:36.333
And then

112
00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:40.791
in this negative noise, many times

113
00:05:40.791 --> 00:05:44.333
you cannot hear the important truth

114
00:05:44.333 --> 00:05:46.791
of your own heart.

115
00:05:46.791 --> 00:05:51.583
You begin to drift from your path.

116
00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:55.041
You start spending time on such things

117
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:58.166
that bring no progress.

118
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:00.291
Remember,

119
00:06:00.291 --> 00:06:02.125
silence

120
00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:05.708
is a strength.

121
00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:07.541
But

122
00:06:07.541 --> 00:06:09.625
here silence does not mean

123
00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:13.166
only being quiet outwardly.

124
00:06:13.166 --> 00:06:16.875
Here silence also means that

125
00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:20.458
the unnecessary and negative chatter

126
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:25.791
running inside the mind is quietened.

127
00:06:25.791 --> 00:06:27.125
When you

128
00:06:27.125 --> 00:06:29.875
practise silence,

129
00:06:29.875 --> 00:06:34.583
you become more aware.

130
00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:38.375
Toward adverse situations and people,

131
00:06:38.375 --> 00:06:42.541
you stop giving immediate reactions.

132
00:06:42.541 --> 00:06:46.750
You pause a little and think,

133
00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:51.291
what I am thinking or about to say,

134
00:06:51.291 --> 00:06:53.208
is it necessary?

135
00:06:53.208 --> 00:06:55.125
Is it useful?

136
00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:58.791
Most importantly,

137
00:06:58.791 --> 00:07:01.875
you stop being swept away

138
00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:05.125
by momentary emotions.

139
00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:08.541
Neither do you sway in praise,

140
00:07:08.541 --> 00:07:13.250
nor does any criticism distress you.

141
00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:15.416
In both states

142
00:07:15.416 --> 00:07:17.875
you think with steadiness,

143
00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:20.625
and move in the right direction.

144
00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:22.708
Think about it,

145
00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:24.333
is taking part in unnecessary

146
00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:27.583
and negative talk,

147
00:07:27.583 --> 00:07:31.666
putting your energy into it,

148
00:07:31.666 --> 00:07:34.166
not a waste?

149
00:07:34.166 --> 00:07:36.166
So

150
00:07:36.166 --> 00:07:39.041
do not react to every

151
00:07:39.041 --> 00:07:42.833
situation and comment.

152
00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:45.833
Pause, think,

153
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:50.166
weigh, and then speak.

154
00:07:50.166 --> 00:07:52.583
Gradually this silence

155
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:56.500
will awaken peace and steadiness within you.

156
00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:57.833
This same silence

157
00:07:57.833 --> 00:08:02.958
also gives you a deep self-awareness.

158
00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:05.375
And then that self-awareness

159
00:08:05.375 --> 00:08:08.750
not only leads you toward progress,

160
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.041
but also connects you

161
00:08:12.041 --> 00:08:14.083
with Me.

162
00:08:18.791 --> 00:08:20.833
In today's society,

163
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:25.250
discontent is spreading everywhere.

164
00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.041
Through your devices

165
00:08:27.041 --> 00:08:29.583
and technology,

166
00:08:29.583 --> 00:08:33.500
you are connected to everyone, but

167
00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.291
because of this, every day

168
00:08:36.291 --> 00:08:39.041
you see something

169
00:08:39.041 --> 00:08:42.125
that others have,

170
00:08:42.125 --> 00:08:44.791
but you do not.

171
00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:46.708
Others' successes,

172
00:08:46.708 --> 00:08:49.083
their foreign travels,

173
00:08:49.083 --> 00:08:55.708
their new cars, their luxuries, and so on.

174
00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:57.625
And in your mind

175
00:08:57.625 --> 00:09:02.833
a small comparison stirs awake,

176
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:04.250
that I am

177
00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:08.875
deprived of all these joys.

178
00:09:08.875 --> 00:09:11.791
But think!

179
00:09:11.791 --> 00:09:14.750
Will comparing yourself with others

180
00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.500
give you peace, or only worry

181
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.083
and unrest?

182
00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:23.750
In this verse

183
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.958
is the word santushthah.

184
00:09:27.958 --> 00:09:31.291
Bring this into your life.

185
00:09:31.291 --> 00:09:33.166
Santushthah,

186
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.416
meaning in what you have,

187
00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:39.708
to experience joy.

188
00:09:39.708 --> 00:09:41.875
When you stop comparing

189
00:09:41.875 --> 00:09:44.875
yourself with others,

190
00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:47.375
then new love

191
00:09:47.375 --> 00:09:50.958
and contentment will arise in you.

192
00:09:50.958 --> 00:09:53.541
And remember,

193
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:56.125
the young members of the home

194
00:09:56.125 --> 00:09:59.666
do not learn only from advice.

195
00:09:59.666 --> 00:10:04.333
They learn by watching your conduct.

196
00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:07.791
If the elder members of the home

197
00:10:07.791 --> 00:10:12.166
are always caught up in criticism, comparison,

198
00:10:12.166 --> 00:10:15.083
or competition,

199
00:10:15.083 --> 00:10:18.875
then how will the young ones learn

200
00:10:18.875 --> 00:10:22.083
the value of self-contentment and gratitude?

201
00:10:22.083 --> 00:10:24.083
Remember this yourself,

202
00:10:24.083 --> 00:10:27.541
and also encourage the children.

203
00:10:27.541 --> 00:10:30.625
Life is a journey

204
00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:33.041
whose ultimate goal

205
00:10:33.041 --> 00:10:35.416
is not material prosperity,

206
00:10:35.416 --> 00:10:38.916
but spiritual progress.

207
00:10:38.916 --> 00:10:42.541
Simply understand it this way, that some people

208
00:10:42.541 --> 00:10:47.041
will make this journey in expensive vehicles,

209
00:10:47.041 --> 00:10:50.416
and some in simple ones.

210
00:10:50.416 --> 00:10:54.916
But in the end, the vehicle is not important.

211
00:10:54.916 --> 00:10:58.250
It is only a means.

212
00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.583
What matters

213
00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:03.000
is reaching the destination.

214
00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.791
Remember,

215
00:11:04.791 --> 00:11:07.291
the more you free yourself

216
00:11:07.291 --> 00:11:10.541
from attachment to material things,

217
00:11:10.541 --> 00:11:15.166
the lighter and more joyful you will feel.

218
00:11:15.166 --> 00:11:16.916
True contentment

219
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:20.291
lies not in gaining more, but

220
00:11:20.291 --> 00:11:24.000
in desiring less.

221
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.125
Keep this in mind.

222
00:11:30.833 --> 00:11:32.666
Ordinarily,

223
00:11:32.666 --> 00:11:34.333
this is what happens,

224
00:11:34.333 --> 00:11:37.791
that praise makes you happy,

225
00:11:37.791 --> 00:11:40.791
and criticism makes you restless.

226
00:11:40.791 --> 00:11:43.875
But think about this.

227
00:11:43.875 --> 00:11:45.458
If for this reason

228
00:11:45.458 --> 00:11:48.875
you begin seeking only praise,

229
00:11:48.875 --> 00:11:53.541
and running away from criticism,

230
00:11:53.541 --> 00:11:56.875
will progress be possible?

231
00:11:56.875 --> 00:11:58.708
In professional life

232
00:11:58.708 --> 00:12:02.500
you will encounter both, but if

233
00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:06.208
you begin working only for praise,

234
00:12:06.208 --> 00:12:09.125
then rather than growing your competence,

235
00:12:09.125 --> 00:12:14.791
you will begin trying to keep others happy.

236
00:12:14.791 --> 00:12:19.791
And if you run away from criticism,

237
00:12:19.791 --> 00:12:23.125
you will lose the opportunity to learn,

238
00:12:23.125 --> 00:12:27.166
because criticism will come precisely about that

239
00:12:27.166 --> 00:12:30.416
where you could have been better.

240
00:12:30.416 --> 00:12:34.250
True wisdom lies in these words,

241
00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:38.333
tulya-ninda-stutih,

242
00:12:38.333 --> 00:12:42.541
meaning praise and criticism,

243
00:12:42.541 --> 00:12:46.250
seeing both with an equal eye.

244
00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.625
This will make you steady

245
00:12:48.625 --> 00:12:51.083
and progressive.

246
00:12:51.083 --> 00:12:52.958
Both have importance.

247
00:12:52.958 --> 00:12:55.708
Both are equal.

248
00:12:55.708 --> 00:12:58.875
Praise motivates you,

249
00:12:58.875 --> 00:13:02.250
and criticism shows you those things

250
00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:05.125
where you can refine yourself.

251
00:13:05.125 --> 00:13:08.625
At the same time, a wise karma yogi

252
00:13:08.625 --> 00:13:11.416
understands that any reaction

253
00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:15.291
from others, whether praise

254
00:13:15.291 --> 00:13:17.125
or a comment, these

255
00:13:17.125 --> 00:13:19.916
both are for their work.

256
00:13:19.916 --> 00:13:24.250
It is not a personal attack on them.

257
00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.250
So receive every response

258
00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:29.625
with an aware mind.

259
00:13:29.625 --> 00:13:32.916
Either draw inspiration from it,

260
00:13:32.916 --> 00:13:35.250
or learn something.

261
00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.250
Doing this, you will not only

262
00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:41.583
move forward in your professional life, but

263
00:13:41.583 --> 00:13:45.750
in your personal and social life too.
